#!/bin/bash

# omarchy:summary=Explain why the legacy Quattro upgrader is unavailable on Omartix
# omarchy:args=[]
# omarchy:examples=omarchy upgrade to quattro

set -euo pipefail

cat >&2 <<'MESSAGE'
omarchy upgrade to quattro is not available on Omartix.

Quattro converted legacy Arch Linux, systemd-backed Omarchy installations to
Omarchy's package-backed layout. Omartix is installed package-backed from the
start and uses Artix with dinit and elogind; running that legacy conversion
would overwrite its repository and service configuration.

Use `omarchy-update` for normal updates.
MESSAGE

exit 1
